\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crushing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Crushing\">Crushing 4</a>:</b> This effect causes the edges of this weapon to ripple with force, dealing 4d6 force damage on each critical hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Spectral_Warhammer_(level_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Spectral_Warhammer_%28level_4%29.png/420px-Spectral_Warhammer_%28level_4%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"539\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Spectral_Warhammer_%28level_4%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/The_Night_Revels\" title=\"The Night Revels\">The Night Revels</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Spectral_Warhammer_(level_8)\" title=\"Item:Spectral Warhammer (level 8)\">Spectral Warhammer (level 8)</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The residual power left behind as thousands of Spectral Dragon Scales crumbled to dust formed this ethereal weapon.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817230347\nCache expiry: 3600\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4187/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36994/2097152 bytes\nT